Description: R package for Robust Community Detection for noisy networks with
    Covariates (RCDC), integrating multiple noisy observations of a latent true
    network with node-level covariates for community detection. It provides
    Markov chain Monte Carlo fitting routines, WAIC-based model selection,
    simulation utilities, and helper functions for robust community detection
    analyses.
